-- 0010_cms_seed.sql
-- =====================================================================
-- Seeds the CMS tables extended in 0009 with the site's REAL current
-- content (mechanically extracted from lib/i18n/dictionaries/content.json
-- and the hardcoded header/footer link arrays), so turning on the new
-- DB-driven read paths does not change anything a visitor sees -- Super
-- Admin now has a live, populated screen to edit going forward instead of
-- landing on an empty CMS.
-- =====================================================================

